  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-non"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>무형</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>안마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-0.0%</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.91yr, B2)</b></span><span class="g fail"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>2/10</b></span></div>
  <div class="fold">▼</div>
