  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-exp"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>확장</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>6.8%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>중간</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-4.4%</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (0.85yr, B2)</b></span><span class="g can"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>6/10</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><b>매수 13명</b></span></div>
