  <div class="gline"><span class="g pt-flt"><i></i><em>VCP 패턴</em> <b>플랫</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>수축깊이</em> <b>4.7%</b></span><span class="g vt"><i></i><em>거래량</em> <b>마름</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><em>돌파전</em> <b>-0.2%</b></span></div><div class="gline"><span class="g"><i></i><em>Stage</em> <b>Stage2 (1.98yr, B3)</b></span><span class="g can"><i></i><em>AI</em> <b>7/10</b></span><span class="g fail"><i></i><em>매출 감속</em> <b>O</b></span><span class="g"><i></i><b>강력 매수 16명</b></span></div>
